  "topPRs": [
    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOLB-lzc6_qSgn",
      "title": "specs: add Upgrade Process to complete upgrade spec",
      "author": "maurelian",
      "number": 881,
      "body": "Adds end-to-end upgrade lifecycle specification:\n\n- 7-phase upgrade workflow (Development → Verification)\n- Transaction execution sequence at fork activation\n- Atomic upgrade execution\n- Cross-chain consistency requirements\n- Fork activation and verification procedures\n\nIncludes 5 invariants, 3 assumptions, and complete lifecycle definition.\nPart 6 of 6-part specification - completes L2 contract upgrades spec.\n\n---\n**Stack:**\n- #876 (Layer 1: Overview + ConditionalDeployer)\n- #877 (Layer 2: L2ProxyAdmin)\n- #878 (Layer 3: L2ContractsManager)\n- #879 (Layer 4: Network Upgrade Transaction Bundle)\n- #880 (Layer 5: Custom Upgrade Block Gas Limit)\n- **→ #881 (Layer 6: Upgrade Process)** ← You are here",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/specs",
      "createdAt": "2026-01-27T17:30:27Z",
      "mergedAt": null,
      "additions": 1171,
      "deletions": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOLB-lzc6_-QCf",
      "title": "specs: add L2 contract upgrades",
